   "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 2 – 4: <br>   </p><blockquote>\nDetermine if it is possible that Jada has each of the following combinations of coins. If so, explain or show how you know. If not, state which constraint—the amount of money or the number of coins—it does not meet.  </blockquote>",
